[en.FOCUS_C12_GREEN_MOUNTAIN_VEINS]
Mine the Green Mountains

[en.FOCUS_C12_GREEN_MOUNTAIN_VEINS_desc]
The Green Mountains have now been confirmed to contain abundant resources. The pristine forests on this land have never been developed before. As long as we utilize them, we can ensure that the ponies of the rock farm will have a warm winter ahead.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_GREEN_MOUNTAIN_VEINS]
绿色山脉的资源

[zh.FOCUS_C12_GREEN_MOUNTAIN_VEINS_desc]
绿色山脉如今被确认蕴含着丰富的资源，这块土地上的原始森林此前也没被开发过，只要我们利用起来，就能让采石农场的小马度过下一个温暖的冬天。

